          "text": "不穿越濃煙，受阻就關門阻煙。"
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "text": "不要搭電梯，安全後撥 119。"
        }
      ],
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED_FOR_HANDOFF"
    },
    {
      "id": "android-guide-typhoon",
      "category": "TYPHOON",
      "headline": "豪雨淹水",
      "callout": "水深不明就不要通過。",
      "sourceId": "sourceCwaRain",
      "steps": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "text": "遠離地下道、河道、邊坡。"
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "text": "移往高處或官方避難所。"
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "text": "通報危險路段並等待救援。"
        }
      ],
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED_FOR_HANDOFF"
    },
    {
      "id": "android-guide-preparedness",
      "category": "PREPAREDNESS",
      "headline": "防災士整備",
      "callout": "平時準備，災時才有選擇。",
      "sourceId": "sourceBousaishiBasic",
      "steps": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "text": "確認家庭防災卡、避難路線與集合點。"
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "text": "固定家具，檢查防災包與 3 日份物資。"
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "text": "只依官方資訊行動，不轉傳未證實災害訊息。"
        }
      ],
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED_FOR_HANDOFF"
